1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,740
Mais de 32 banhos públicos.

2
00:00:02,740 --> 00:00:03,820
Numa cidade só.

3
00:00:03,820 --> 00:00:05,960
Dizem que ninguém tomava banho.

4
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:07,840
Paris, século 13.

5
00:00:08,310 --> 00:00:09,670
Mas em casa,

6
00:00:09,670 --> 00:00:12,030
encher uma tina custava caro.

7
00:00:12,030 --> 00:00:14,230
Água carregada e aquecida.

8
00:00:14,230 --> 00:00:15,250
No dia a dia,

9
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:16,460
só bacia.

10
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:17,420
Na rua,

11
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:18,680
banho era negócio.

12
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:20,300
Com guilda e regras.

13
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:21,780
Vapor: 2 denários.

14
00:00:21,780 --> 00:00:22,680
Banho completo:

15
00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:23,880
4 denários.

16
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:25,800
Até pregoeiros gritavam pelas ruas,

17
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:26,860
chamando clientes.

18
00:00:27,210 --> 00:00:29,030
Londres tinha 13.

19
00:00:29,030 --> 00:00:30,590
Viena chegou a 29.

20
00:00:30,970 --> 00:00:32,450
E Paris...
